const SG_L=(x1,y1,x2,y2,col='#5C6577',w=2,ex='')=>`<line x1="${x1}" y1="${y1}" x2="${x2}" y2="${y2}" stroke="${col}" stroke-width="${w}" stroke-linecap="round" ${ex}/>`;
const SG_box=(x,y,w,h,o={})=>`<rect x="${x}" y="${y}" width="${w}" height="${h}" rx="${o.r??14}" fill="${o.fill||'#FFFFFF'}" stroke="${o.st||'#CED4DA'}" stroke-width="${o.sw||2}"/>`;
/* a curve of computed points: f(t) for t in [t0,t1], mapped to x in [x0,x1] and y = yc - k*f */
const SG_curve=(f,t0,t1,x0,x1,yc,k,col,w=4,n=120,ex='')=>{let p=[];for(let i=0;i<=n;i++){const t=t0+(t1-t0)*i/n;p.push(`${(x0+(x1-x0)*i/n).toFixed(1)},${(yc-k*f(t)).toFixed(1)}`)}return `<polyline points="${p.join(' ')}" fill="none" stroke="${col}" stroke-width="${w}" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" ${ex}/>`};
/* the area under f between t0 and t1, filled down to the axis yc */
const SG_area=(f,t0,t1,x0,x1,yc,k,col,op=.25,n=80)=>{let p=[`${x0},${yc}`];for(let i=0;i<=n;i++){const t=t0+(t1-t0)*i/n;p.push(`${(x0+(x1-x0)*i/n).toFixed(1)},${(yc-k*f(t)).toFixed(1)}`)}p.push(`${x1},${yc}`);return `<polygon points="${p.join(' ')}" fill="${col}" fill-opacity="${op}"/>`};
const SG_arrow=(x1,y1,x2,y2,col='#18213A',w=3)=>{const a=Math.atan2(y2-y1,x2-x1),h=14;return SG_L(x1,y1,x2-h*.6*Math.cos(a),y2-h*.6*Math.sin(a),col,w)+`<polygon points="${x2},${y2} ${(x2-h*Math.cos(a)+h*.5*Math.sin(a)).toFixed(1)},${(y2-h*Math.sin(a)-h*.5*Math.cos(a)).toFixed(1)} ${(x2-h*Math.cos(a)-h*.5*Math.sin(a)).toFixed(1)},${(y2-h*Math.sin(a)+h*.5*Math.cos(a)).toFixed(1)}" fill="${col}"/>`};
/* an impulse: a stem with an arrowhead */
const SG_imp=(x,y0,h,col,w=4)=>SG_arrow(x,y0,x,y0-h,col,w);
const SG_X=(x,y,s,col)=>SG_L(x-s,y-s,x+s,y+s,col,7)+SG_L(x-s,y+s,x+s,y-s,col,7);
const SG_tick=(x,y,s,col)=>`<polyline points="${x-s},${y} ${x-s*.3},${y+s*.7} ${x+s},${y-s*.8}" fill="none" stroke="${col}" stroke-width="7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>`;
/* the lesson's own signals, all computed */
const SG_h=t=>t<0?0:Math.exp(-t);                 // RC impulse response, t in units of tau (height 1/tau)
const SG_s=t=>t<0?0:1-Math.exp(-t);               // RC step response
const SG_ring=t=>t<0?0:Math.exp(-0.9*t)*Math.cos(2*Math.PI*1.6*t);   // a decaying echo, for the hook
const SG_song=t=>0.55*Math.sin(2*Math.PI*1.1*t)+0.3*Math.sin(2*Math.PI*2.9*t+1)+0.15*Math.sin(2*Math.PI*5.3*t);
const SG_SL=t=>t<0?0:1-0.5*Math.exp(-2*t);        // the measured step response of the second example

